---
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<section id="projects" class="py-24 bg-slate-900">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6">

    <div class="text-center">
      <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold text-white">
        Enterprise Projects
      </h2>

      <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-slate-400 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        A collection of enterprise infrastructure projects built and maintained
        in my professional homelab environment.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-16 grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-2">

      <!-- Active Directory -->
      <a
        href={`${base}projects/active-directory`}
        class="block rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-950 p-8 shadow-xl transition hover:-translate-y-2 hover:border-cyan-500"
      >

        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-cyan-400">
          Enterprise Active Directory
        </h3>

        <p class="mt-4 text-slate-400">
          Built a redundant Active Directory environment with multiple Domain
          Controllers, DNS, DHCP, Group Policy, Organizational Units and user
          management.
        </p>

        <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
          <span class="rounded bg-cyan-600 px-3 py-1 text-sm">Windows Server</span>
          <span class="rounded bg-cyan-600 px-3 py-1 text-sm">Active Directory</span>
          <span class="rounded bg-cyan-600 px-3 py-1 text-sm">DNS</span>
          <span class="rounded bg-cyan-600 px-3 py-1 text-sm">Group Policy</span>
        </div>

      </a>

      <!-- Monitoring -->
      <a
        href={`${base}projects/monitoring`}
        class="block rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-950 p-8 shadow-xl transition hover:-translate-y-2 hover:border-cyan-500"
      >

        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-cyan-400">
          Enterprise Monitoring Stack
        </h3>

        <p class="mt-4 text-slate-400">
          Designed a monitoring platform using Prometheus, Grafana and Wazuh to
          provide metrics, dashboards, logging and security monitoring.
        </p>

        <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
          <span class="rounded bg-cyan-600 px-3 py-1 text-sm">Grafana</span>
          <span class="rounded bg-cyan-600 px-3 py-1 text-sm">Prometheus</span>
          <span class="rounded bg-cyan-600 px-3 py-1 text-sm">Wazuh</span>
          <span class="rounded bg-cyan-600 px-3 py-1 text-sm">Alerting</span>
        </div>

      </a>

      <!-- Automation -->
      <a
        href={`${base}projects/automation`}
        class="block rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-950 p-8 shadow-xl transition hover:-translate-y-2 hover:border-cyan-500"
      >

        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-cyan-400">
          Infrastructure Automation
        </h3>

        <p class="mt-4 text-slate-400">
          Automated Linux and Windows administration using Ansible, reducing
          manual configuration and improving consistency across enterprise
          systems.
        </p>

        <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
          <span class="rounded bg-cyan-600 px-3 py-1 text-sm">Ansible</span>
          <span class="rounded bg-cyan-600 px-3 py-1 text-sm">Linux</span>
          <span class="rounded bg-cyan-600 px-3 py-1 text-sm">Windows</span>
          <span class="rounded bg-cyan-600 px-3 py-1 text-sm">SSH</span>
        </div>

      </a>

      <!-- Infrastructure -->
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-950 p-8 shadow-xl">
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-cyan-400">
          Virtualized Enterprise Infrastructure
        </h3>

        <p class="mt-4 text-slate-400">
          Designed and deployed a segmented enterprise network using Proxmox,
          pfSense, VLANs, routing, firewall policies and virtualization.
        </p>

        <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
          <span class="rounded bg-cyan-600 px-3 py-1 text-sm">Proxmox</span>
          <span class="rounded bg-cyan-600 px-3 py-1 text-sm">pfSense</span>
          <span class="rounded bg-cyan-600 px-3 py-1 text-sm">VLANs</span>
          <span class="rounded bg-cyan-600 px-3 py-1 text-sm">Networking</span>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>
